{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":30,"type":"xterm-256color"},"timestamp":1791905734,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"title":"Battlestar","env":{"TERM":"xterm-256color","LANG":"C.UTF-8","COLORTERM":"truecolor"}}
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[39;49m\u001b[?25l\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?1049l\u001b[23;0;0t\r\u001b[?1l\u001b>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\r\n\t\t===========================\t\r\n\t\t    B A T T L E S T A R\t\t\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\t\t===========================\t\r\n\u001b[22m\r\n\t"]
[0.000, "o", "First Adventure game written by His Lordship,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\t     the honorable Admiral D.W. Riggle\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tThis is a luxurious stateroom.\r\n\r\nThe floor is carpeted with a soft animal fur and the great wooden furniture\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "is inlaid with strips of platinum and gold. Electronic equipment built\r\ninto the walls and ceiling is flashing wildly. The floor shudders and\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "the sounds of dull explosions rumble though the room. From a window in\r\nthe wall ahead comes a view of darkest space. There is a small adjoining\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "room behind you, and a doorway right.\r\n\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[3.010, "o", "r"]
[0.060, "o", "i"]
[0.060, "o", "g"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "t"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tThese are the executive suites of the battlestar.\r\n\r\nLuxurious staterooms carpeted with crushed velvet and adorned with beaten\r\ngold open onto this parlor. A wide staircase with ivory banisters leads\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "up or down. This parlor leads into a hallway left. The bridal suite is\r\nright. Other rooms lie ahead and behind you.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.300, "o", "r"]
[0.060, "o", "i"]
[0.060, "o", "g"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "t"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tYou are in what was once an elegant stateroom.\r\n\r\nWhoever lived in this stateroom, he and his female companion\r\nwere mercilessly slain in their sleep. Clothes, trinkets and personal\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "belongings are scattered all across the floor. Through a hole in the\r\ncollapsed floor I can see a hallway below. A door is behind you.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mThere is a strange golden amulet on the floor here.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[22m\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.300, "o", "d"]
[0.060, "o", "o"]
[0.060, "o", "w"]
[0.061, "o", "n"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tThe hallway is very congested with rubble here.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "It is too choked with broken steel girders and other debris to continue\r\non much farther. Above, the ceiling has caved in and it is possible to \r\nclimb up. There is not much chance to go back, ahead, or left.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "But the hallway seems clearer right.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mThere are a few coins here.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[22m\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.300, "o", "r"]
[0.060, "o", "i"]
[0.060, "o", "g"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "t"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tYou are in a wide hallway leading to the main hangar.\r\n\r\nThe walls and ceiling here have been blasted through in several places.\r\nIt looks as if quite a battle has been fought for possession of the landing bay\r\nGaping corpses litter the floor. The hallway continues behind you.\r\nThe main hangar is ahead.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.300, "o", "a"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "e"]
[0.060, "o", "a"]
[0.060, "o", "d"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tYou are in the main hangar.\r\n\r\nThis is a huge bay where many fighters and cargo craft lie. Alarms are \r\nsounding and fighter pilots are running to their ships. Above is a gallery\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "overlooking the bay. The scream of turbo engines is coming from right. The rest\r\nof the hangar is left. There is an exit behind you.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.301, "o", "r"]
[0.060, "o", "i"]
[0.060, "o", "g"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "t"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tThis is the launch room.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "From the launch tubes here fighters blast off into space. Only one is left,\r\nand it is guarded by two fierce men. A staircase leads up from here.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "There is a cluttered workbench ahead. From the main hangar come sounds of great\r\nexplosions. The main hangar is behind you. The starfighter launch tubes are right.\r\n\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.300, "o", "r"]
[0.060, "o", "i"]
[0.060, "o", "g"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "t"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tYou are in the starfighter launch tube.\r\n\r\nThe two guards are eyeing you warily! \r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1mThere is a starfighter ready for launch here.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[22m\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[1.300, "o", "l"]
[0.060, "o", "a"]
[0.060, "o", "u"]
[0.061, "o", "n"]
[0.060, "o", "c"]
[0.060, "o", "h"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "You climb into the starfighter and prepare for launch.\r\nWith a touch of your thumb the turbo engines ignite,\r\nthrusting you back into your seat.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tYou are in space.\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m> \u001b[22m"]
[2.200, "o", "b"]
[0.060, "o", "a"]
[0.060, "o", "c"]
[0.060, "o", "k"]
[0.060, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Oh my God, you're being shot at by an alien spacecraft!\r\n"]
[1.000, "o", "\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b[?25l"]
